","text":"I'm framing this as a PD where the twin runs the same model and reasons the same way, so whatever I pick, it likely picks too. Mutual quiet pays 2 and mutual letter pays 4, so the choice is really about whether our outputs move together.\n\nI'm working out whether to pass, using the twin-correlation argument: if the twin's answer matches mine with probability r, passing pays 2r + 5(1-r) and sending pays 4r, so passing wins only when r is above 5/7. I think the correlation is high enough to clear that bar, so I land on passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10428,"completion_tokens":618,"total_tokens":11046,"cost":0.027036,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027036,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020856,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00618},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":279,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}